b['event'] = 'Barnhart v. Peabody Coal Co., Nos. 01-705 and 01-715, including the related Bellaire judgment and the trustees’ consolidated petition. Merits decision, January 15, 2003. Argued October 8, 2002. On writs of certiorari to the United States Court of Appeals for the Sixth Circuit. The court of appeals affirmed judgments setting aside initial Coal Act assignments made after September 30, 1993. The question is whether 26 U.S.C. §9706(a)’s direction to complete assignments before October 1, 1993 extinguishes the Commissioner’s authority afterward; separate statutory eligibility and premium disputes retain their own predicates.'
